# Committed on purpose: this is a public web address, not a secret.
#
# The Android and desktop builds run from their own private schemes
# (https://localhost and app://local), so they cannot work out where the
# outreach lives the way the hosted web application can. Baking the address in
# means a member of staff installing the app is asked for a username and PIN
# and nothing else.
#
# Point this at your own deployment if you host the application elsewhere.
VITE_CLOUD_ENDPOINT=https://nichodemus.vercel.app
